# *.csv
# *.parquet
# *.json
# *.db
# *.sqlite

# Benchmark datasets + generated ingest outputs (downloaded data, per-benchmark
# JSONL, and manifests are large / reproducible artifacts — never committed).
# The ingestion runbook lives at scripts/benchmarks/README.md (tracked).
# Written as "/**" plus a directory re-include rather than "data/eval/benchmarks/"
# because git CANNOT re-include a file whose parent DIRECTORY is excluded — it
# never descends into it, so the gold_validity.json negation below would be dead.
data/eval/benchmarks/**
!data/eval/benchmarks/*/
# EXCEPT the gold-validity sidecars. These are small (single-digit KB) EVIDENCE
# files, not bulk data: notebook 12's coverage gate reads them to exclude rows
# whose gold SQL cannot run on Athena. Untracked, a fresh clone silently falls
# back to the raw denominator and reports 89.4% coverage instead of 99.55%.
# They also cannot be regenerated offline — the probe needs live Athena.
!data/eval/benchmarks/*/gold_validity.json

